heb>, agreeing with <bdbheb>בְּגָדִים</bdbheb> preceding; yet this elsewhere in Hebrew only of animals); in simile of daughter of Babylon, <ref ref=\"Jer 51:33\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,33)\">Jer 51:33</ref> (trodden smooth) compare figurative of Israel <bdbheb>בֶּןגָּֿרְנִי</bdbheb> || <bdbheb>(מדֻשָׁתִיׅ</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Isa 21:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,21,10)\">Isa 21:10</ref> .... <bdbheb>מֹץ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִגּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 13:3\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(28,13,3)\">Hos 13:3</ref>. </p><hr><p><bdbheb>גָּרֹן</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>גָּרוֺן</bdbheb> see below <bdbheb>גרה</bdbheb>. </p><hr><p><bdbheb>גָּרַס</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> see below <bdbheb>גרשׂ</bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 50:10", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 50, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Gen 50:11", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 50, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "2Sam 6:6", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 6, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Mic 4:12", "book": "MIC", "chapter": 4, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Isa 21:10", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 21, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Deut 15:14", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 15, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Deut 16:13", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 16, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "1Sam 23:1", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 23, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Joel 2:24", "book": "JOL", "chapter": 2, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Hos 9:1", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 9, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Num 18:27", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 18, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Judg 6:37", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 6, "verse": 37}, {"raw": "Ruth 3:2", "book": "RUT", "chapter": 3, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Ruth 3:3", "book": "RUT", "chapter": 3, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Ruth 3:6", "book": "RUT", "chapter": 3, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Ruth 3:14", "book": "RUT", "chapter": 3, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "2Sam 24:16", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 24, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "2Sam 24:18", "boo